摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"🐋 Live dot-matrix whale wallpaper plugin for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web UI — 1,750 breathing WebGL2 particles, pointer vortices, light/dark themes · 深度求索 Harness 点阵鲸鱼动态壁纸插件","id":"gh:1356634141","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"deepseek-whale-wallpaper","slug":"HeShen-1/deepseek-whale-wallpaper","topics":["deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","live-wallpaper","plugin","wallpaper","webgl"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"🐋 Live dot-matrix whale wallpaper plugin for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web UI — 1,750 breathing Web"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"GL2 particles, pointer vortices, light/dark themes · 深度求索 Harness 点阵鲸鱼动态壁纸插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🐋 Harness Whale Wallpaper"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A live wallpaper plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web UI** — the dot-matrix whale you know from Dee"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"pSeek, rebuilt as ≈1,750 breathing WebGL2 particles that slowly turn in the mist and swirl around yo"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ur pointer like liquid. Light and dark themes both included. No branding, no particle connection-lin"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" liquid. Light and dark themes both included. No branding, no particle connection-lines, no clutter."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 📣 Listed in awesome-dsh-plugin — the curated DeepSeek Harness plugin list."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Demo"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Both themes are live wallpapers: the whale keeps breathing and turning, mist drifts, and when your p"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ointer crosses the whale, nearby particles swirl around it like a liquid vortex (motion only — no gl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ow or ring) and softly settle back (~800 ms). GIFs below run at exactly 2× speed — 18 frames of 100 "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ms of animation each, captured through a deterministic clock rather than a screen recorder, so no fr"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ame is a time lapse and the real pace is calmer. **Try the live preview →**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Dark mode"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Light mode"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Inside the real Harness UI"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Captured from a live DeepSeek Harness web client. The wallpaper layer sits *beneath* the app frame —"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" sidebar, conversation canvas and input area keep working, particles swirl behind the interface."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Light UI | Dark UI |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 📦 Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requires the DeepSeek Harness dev-preview (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`) with its `web` profile."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### A. From a release tarball"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Download `dsh-plugin-harness-whale-<version>.tgz` from Releases and extract the `package/` folder"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ownload `dsh-plugin-harness-whale-<version>.tgz` from Releases and extract the `package/` folder to:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"2. Register it in the `insert` list of `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"3. Restart `dsh web` and refresh http://127.0.0.1:3080 — the whale appears behind the app. Tweak the"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" values above for a non-default look."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### B. Look before you leap"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Open the **online preview** — the same render kernel as the plugin, no install needed."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Override per-profile via `cordis.patch.yml`; defaults live in the plugin's own `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |\n| --- | ---: | --- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | Enable wallpaper + theme o"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"verrides |\n| `quality` | `auto` | `auto` / `low` / `medium` / `high` |\n| `brightness` | `0.9` | Whal"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"e brightness, 0.35–1.4 |\n| `scale` | `1` | Whale size, 0.72–1.25 |\n| `interactionStrength` | `1` | P"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"arallax and vortex strength, 0–1.5 |\n| `activeDimming` | `0.22` | Opacity while typing/running, 0.12"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"x and vortex strength, 0–1.5 |\n| `activeDimming` | `0.22` | Opacity while typing/running, 0.12–0.6 |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Values are validated host-side by Schemastery and served to the client through a same-origin read-on"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ly endpoint. If public slots or required services are missing in your Harness build, the plugin logs"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" a clear error and stops safely."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🌊 Behavior"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The whale outline is sampled directly from the `favicon.svg` path in this repo — WebGL2 renders ≈1"},{"id":"p28s2","text":",750 regular grid points.\n- ~11 s vertical breathing, a ~29 s slow turn, plus tail-fin motion and ge"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ntle buoyancy; the pointer adds ~6° parallax and a positional offset.\n- Inside the whale, particles "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"within ~200 px of the pointer form a continuous liquid vortex (motion-only feedback, no brightness o"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"r size change); after the pointer leaves they settle back softly in ~800 ms. The base dot matrix is "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"never modified.\n- Follows the Harness appearance setting (light / dark / system): dark keeps white→i"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ce-blue particles over a deepened pool, light switches to high-contrast ink `#050b14` over a brighte"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"ned pool, with matching semantic tokens, mist layers and background.\n- Both themes expose the full-s"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"creen base layer behind the app frame; sidebar, inputs, conversation content and settings windows ke"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"ep their own surfaces — no full-screen veil washing out the dots. The reading scrim covers the measu"},{"id":"p28s11","text":"red text blocks only, not the whole column, so the ink keeps its near-black (light) / white (dark) v"},{"id":"p28s12","text":"alue in every margin no glyph touches.\n- Full brightness with no session open; ~78 % once a session "},{"id":"p28s13","text":"opens; at least 50 % while typing or a task runs (still honors a stronger `activeDimming`), ~600 ms "},{"id":"p28s14","text":"transitions.\n- Pauses when the page is hidden; completely still under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduc"},{"id":"p28s15","text":"e`.\n- DPR capped at 1.5; `auto` steps down high → medium → low after sustained frame drops.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🧩 Architecture & ecosystem"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"This is one of the first third-party client plugins for DeepSeek Harness. It participates in the lif"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ecycle through the public `shell.overlay` slot: the wallpaper canvas is prepended beneath the app fr"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ame and never blocks Harness controls."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Zero runtime dependencies; three devDependencies (esbuild, typescript, schemastery). `lib/` and `pre"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"view.js` are build artifacts produced by `pnpm build`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 🔭 Compatibility"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Built against the browser web UI of `@deepseek-ai/dsh`, verified up to `0.1.6-alpha.1`. The Harness "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"is in dev-preview, so a release can move the DOM hooks this plugin leans on (it happened twice: the "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"shell frame lost `data-details-collapsed` in 0.1.5, and the conversation slot was renamed to `main.c"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"st `data-details-collapsed` in 0.1.5, and the conversation slot was renamed to `main.conversation`)."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Three guards exist for that, and none of them require reading this file first:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- `npm run compat` checks the *installed* Harness for every hook the plugin uses and names what a mi"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ssing one would break. Run it after upgrading the Harness, before restarting the GUI.\n- `window.__ha"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"rnessWhale.check()` (and `document.documentElement.dataset.hwwStatus`) reports the live state: which"},{"id":"p36s4","text":" surfaces are transparent, how much wallpaper survives at five sample points, and `failed` if the pl"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"ugin could not mount at all.\n- If a hook moved, the whale simply stops being visible — the shell is "},{"id":"p36s6","text":"left exactly as it was, and docs/compatibility.md lists each hook, its Harness range, and the sympto"},{"id":"p36s7","text":"m. `release/*.tgz` holds every previous build for a one-command rollback."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Every hook that turns out to be stale is now a build-time failure: `npm run check` refuses to ship a"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" bundle whose selectors or ink constants drifted."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
